# Actor kind $23 (Kind23Start $83:9CEB, Kind23Second 9D43), which no play
# makes: its one placement (stage a5 s2) is at x and y $3FFF, which no view
# reaches. On stage a5 s2 at frame 30 the kind $2D record $0BFB is made
# kind $23 with $07 0 and put in its start state ($0C): it makes four
# children of its kind and ends; each shows itself for $1A frames, makes a
